TextMesh:
  serializedVersion: 3
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6535738409203204672}
  m_Text: 'Station air:

    SULFUR-RICH

    (process gases nearby).


    Sulfur
    can attack the silver

    in standard terminations.

    Anti-sulfur types are
    built

    to resist it. Look for the

    green dot on the body.'
