  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2993576058189133598}
  m_Text: 'Rated power is given at 70 C.

    Derates linearly to 0 W at 155 C.

    This
    board runs at 85 C:

    usable power = rated x 0.82.

    Pads fit parts up
    to 1/4 W.'
